FreeSDN Caddy 2.11.4 rebuild: third-party notices, 2026-09-22.
Go 1.27.1; dependency versions and checksums are recorded in go.mod/go.sum.
OpenTelemetry logging exporters are upgraded together to 0.22.0.
CEL 0.30.0 replaces the vulnerable 0.28.1 hold. FreeSDN changes only two
Interpretable argument slice types in Caddy celmatcher.go; prepare.go verifies
the exact upstream source hash before patching a private vendor tree.
No vulnerability waiver is applied. This is a modified FreeSDN build, not an upstream binary.

